/*
 * SliceExpander — expands slice and array operators into YIL instructions.
 *
 * The SliceExpander lowers high-level slice and array operations into
 * concrete YILValue and YILInstr nodes. It handles:
 *
 *   - array indexing,
 *   - slice indexing,
 *   - slice append,
 *   - slice concatenation.
 *
 * Slice concatenation and append operations emit runtime calls and must be
 * executed only once; unique-value registration ensures this property.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::lint::expander::value::slice
 * @File: ymirc/lint/expander/value/slice.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-06-23
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
